#: docs/status/ledgers.md:8
msgid "Historical execution ledgers"
msgstr "历史执行台账"

#: docs/status/ledgers.md:10
msgid ""
"The original CSV files and derived views retain their original IDs, source, "
"exit conditions and evidence references. They are not the current production "
"support catalogue and are excluded from current-site navigation and "
"translation admission. Their source-byte checks remain available "
"independently."
msgstr ""
"原始 CSV 与派生视图保留原 ID、源码、退出条件和证据引用。它们不是当前生产支持目录，也不进入当前站点导航和翻译准入。其源码字节检查仍可独立执行。"

#: docs/status/ledgers.md:15
msgid ""
"Read [the fixed original views](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/ledgers) "
"when auditing those executions. The current refactor does not rewrite "
"historical results or create another competing task ledger."
msgstr ""
"审查这些执行时，阅读[固定原始视图](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/status/ledgers)。当前重构不改写历史结果，也不创建另一套相互竞争的任务台账。"

